ries were imputed for suppressed beneficiary counts to provide a conservative estimate of the prescribing rate.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The antibiotic prescribing rate was compared between the defined national subset of higher-volume prescribers and lower-volume prescribers by specialty and U.S. Census Bureau region.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}